OL,3,GNEWSACharity creates mental health
OL,4,Apacks for schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Amy Watson's partner Joe Phipps
OL,7,Ftook his own life, her children
OL,8,Fstruggled to come to terms with his
OL,9,Floss.
OL,11,FTwo years on, and based on the lessons
OL,12,Fshe learned with her own children, she
OL,13,Fhas created packs for primary schools
OL,14,Fto use to help children cope with their
OL,15,Ffeelings.
OL,17,FWatson, a 30-year-old mum from
OL,18,FHoneybourne, Worcestershire, said
OL,19,Fexplaining her partner's death to her
OL,20,Fchildren who were six and 11 at the
OL,21,Ftime, made her realise there was a gap
OL,22,Fin the support available.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
